{"id":878561,"title":"05｜主流的AI智能体框架","content":"介绍了主流AI Agent框架，重点对比了Coze和Dify。对于C端用户及小型企业，推荐使用Coze，因其在工具能力、工作流生态、插件系统、低代码应用开发等方面表现卓越，并且拥有丰富的模板、文档、API接口及SDK支持。而对于需要私有化部署、重视数据安全的大规模企业，Dify是更合适的选择。Dify允许用户无需编写代码即可构建智能体，同时也支持通过简单的代码节点来处理复杂需求，适合具备一定IT背景的产品经理或运维人员使用。总之，选择合适的AI Agent框架需基于具体应用场景和技术要求。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":401965,"user_name":"Black船长","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":2016786,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"B0B73E8DEB56C4","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1e/c6/12/7c36aa3a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1754846208,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"coze已经开源了..时效要更新下","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400681,"user_name":"Edison Zhou","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1191877,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"DDD50EA2335CAC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/2f/c5/55832856.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748962275,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"Dify相对FastGPT有啥优势吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400576,"user_name":"极简架构","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1769171,"ip_address":"黑龙江","ucode":"B31C9E0921F64A","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/fe/d3/d9c1b183.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748361402,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"应该讲解下每种产品按照不同维度进行对比说明优劣势","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400523,"user_name":"美妙的代码","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1111985,"ip_address":"四川","ucode":"9DADD72C193296","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/f7/b1/982ea185.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748175670,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,